# P16 UE's revolve generators in Modeling > Shapes: Revolve (FRevolvePlanarPolygonGenerator, a rectangle
# profile turned 270 degrees about +Y, ends capped) and Spiral (FSpiralRevolvePlanarPolygonGenerator, a round
# profile on a rising 720-degree helix, ends capped), default parameters, side by side; Undo of the last one.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.5,-0.55,0.65
Когда run Modeling "Create shape tool: Revolve"
Когда run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject selection set Translation -90,0,0
Когда run Modeling "Create shape tool: Spiral"
Когда run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Когда --subject selection set Translation 90,0,0
Тогда-вид 0_shapes left a thick ring (rectangular cross-section) open by a quarter with both cut ends capped flat; right a round-section coil spring of two turns rising upward, both ends capped; both closed, lit from outside, no black or inside-out faces
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 1_undo the spring is gone, the capped ring on the left stays
